# sede_seat_cues.voc
#
# WHAT: words that, appearing near "sede", signal the SEAT / headquarters
#       reading — open ɛ, /ˈsɛdɨ/ ("a sede da empresa", "na sede do partido").
# WHERE USED: bifonia/scoring.py → resolve_sense(), the meaning tiebreaker for
#       "sede" (both its senses are NOUNS, so POS alone cannot disambiguate them).
# EFFECT: each cue token found in the ±3 window adds to the "seat" score; the
#       higher of seat/thirst wins. Organisation nouns that a HQ belongs to, plus
#       location/establishment verbs.
# HOW TO EXTEND: add any organisation type or "is-located/was-founded" verb that
#       collocates with a headquarters. One term per line, lowercase, no diacritic
#       stripping needed (matched against lowercased tokens).
